        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Quick Reference Guide",
        "content": "### Behavioral Bias Cheat Sheet\n\n| Bias | Trigger | Solution |\n|------|---------|----------|\n| Anchoring | Calculating discount from MRP | Think about actual value |\n| Loss Aversion | Holding because of fear of loss | Pre-set stop loss |\n| Herd Mentality | Everyone is doing it, so will I | Independent thinking |\n| Confirmation | Only reading supportive info | Find opposite view |\n| Recency | Assuming recent results will continue | Look at historical average |\n| Endowment | Overvaluing what you own | Accept market price |\n| Sunk Cost | \"Money is gone, can't quit\" | Think about future, not past |\n| Present Bias | Enjoy today, save tomorrow | Set up auto-debit |\n| Mental Accounting | Bonus is different, salary is different | Treat all money the same |\n| Framing | \"95% success\" vs \"5% failure\" | Look at numbers |\n| Availability | Overestimating risk from news | Find statistics |\n| Overconfidence | I know everything | Stay humble |\n\n### Emotional Spending First Aid\n\n| Emotion | Trigger | First Aid |\n|---------|---------|-----------|\n| Stress | Exam, work pressure | 10 min walk, deep breathing |\n| Boredom | Free time, scrolling | Book, exercise, call friend |\n| Sadness | Breakup, rejection | Talk, journal, cry it out |\n| FOMO | Sale, friends buying | 24-hour rule, unfollow |\n| Comparison | Social media, neighbors | Gratitude, limit screen time |\n| Celebration | Exam passed, achievement | Pre-decide budget |\n| Impulse | Checkout page | Keep in cart for 24 hours |\n| Reward | \"I worked hard\" | Non-monetary reward |\n| Procrastination | \"I'll do it from tomorrow\" | 5-minute rule |\n| Guilt | Post-purchase guilt | Return or accept |",
        "color": "#10B981",
        "emoji": "🧘",
        "interactiveType": "none"
